# Normalize text files in the repo, but never touch the PoC reference
# dictionaries: tests/ExtImeDicBuilder.Core.Tests/PocByteExactTests.cs
# compares generated output against these files byte for byte, and they
# intentionally encode newlines as numeric character references (&#13; /
# &#10;). Any EOL conversion here would break those tests on a fresh clone.
* text=auto
*.dctx binary
*.ico binary
